edgecall (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release. Route plain-language requests to pre-registered
    functions using a weak local model and a paginated menu.
  * OpenAI-compatible /v1/chat/completions shim plus native /v1/dispatch.
  * Drop-in function autoloader; example functions for message-of-the-day
    (from a text file), gold price, weather, time, and dice.

